READABLE={
'T43.03.c':('The retained clone batch records completed byte prefixes0,1,8 and37 across failures and success. For payload lengths1,7,29,2,100,3,5,11, doubling copies48 bytes plus158 append bytes, total206. Each payload is recopied at most ceil(log2 N) times; failed attempts add their actual completed clone prefixes.','Move-only handles have constant descriptor size. Acquire replacement storage before transferring ownership, invalidate the old descriptors after publication, and permit no fallible operation after transfer. Allocation failure preserves old owners.'),
'T43.04.c':('The explicit sequential and nested graphs each have6 nodes and7 edges, metric3, while n8 work is16 versus64. Validation rejects duplicate edges and disconnected nodes. Separately compiled C functions report the two work counts and actual symbol byte sizes.','Reroute the existing inner-scan termination continuation from the outer predicate to the exit. E and N stay unchanged, while sentinel-dependent termination now exits the whole scan. Feasible paths and work change despite metric3; adding a new independent branch would instead require recomputing the metric.'),
'T43.08.a':('The retained writer executes40 cursor/fault cases. Positive results advance once; retries consume budget; zero, EIO and over-reporting stop with the exact accepted prefix. Four attempts of3,retry,2,retry end at prefix5.','The vectored cursor crosses extents3,2,3 through six partial writes and yields abcdefgh exactly once. Each borrow is limited to the current live span.'),
'T43.08.b':('The owned file records accepted bytes, write interval, actual fsync interval and status. A local synchronizer injection returns failure despite readable bytes; it is explicitly not a kernel error observation.','The actual sequence is write8, file fsync, rename, directory fsync. These requested boundaries do not establish survival through power loss.'),
'T43.08.c':('The captured shared4096/logical8 ratio is512 only for that scope. Actual sparse-file length, allocation blocks and logical payload are separate; physical traffic remains unavailable.','Preallocation preserves the same8 payload bytes while reporting actual allocation units before and after. st_blocks is storage allocation, not device write traffic.'),
'T43.09.a':('C interval arithmetic accepts a1ns borrow and equal zero, then rejects reversed, unnormalized and overflowing intervals without publishing. Actual clock resolution is recorded separately from bracket cost.','The wrapping counter requires an independently supplied bound below2^32. Its observed modular delta cannot establish that bound; a full-wrap allowance is ambiguous.'),
'T43.09.b':('Actual31 pairs at three sizes retain pair identities, alternating order,8192 queries and checksums. Median paired difference and difference of medians are separate statistics; the parent example gives3 versus4.','Synthetic linear drift gives31 units of blocked-order bias versus1 with alternation despite zero treatment effect. Actual scheduling noise remains visible and no significance claim is inferred.'),
'T43.09.c':('Nearest-rank p95, strict misses, sample size and maximum retain outliers. Adding a10000-unit trial changes the tail; no finite maximum becomes WCET.','Two timeout censors remain in the population. With one observed miss the miss lower bound is3; a quantile beyond the censor threshold remains unresolved.'),
'T43.10.a':('Four actual caller-thread hardware event requests retain event identity, status, errno or raw count, CPU model, kernel and binary hash. They currently return ENOENT unavailable; no host policy is changed.','A different CPU requires new event authority and actual observations. A generalized event name cannot transfer cache or retirement semantics by itself.'),
'T43.10.b':('Checked rational scaling gives2400 and6000 and CPI5/2. Zero-running, running greater than enabled, mixed groups, duplicate IDs and overflow reject. A measured raw zero is valid.','Two equal-duration phases with1000 and100 events yield estimates2000 or200 depending on the sampled phase, despite the same10/20 fraction. Scaling assumes representativeness.'),
'T43.10.c':('Semantic work and elapsed times are available while hardware instruction, branch and cache counts remain null. Frequency and memory-stall hypotheses need different discriminating observations.','Alternating and LCG condition streams retain one million comparisons and separate checksums/times. Linked disassembly is retained because a source if may become branchless; branch-miss causality remains open.'),
'T43.11.a':('The observer reads existing membership, mount information, ancestor limits, CPU, memory, IO and pressure fields. Missing data stays unknown; policy and membership writes are zero.','No already-prepared owned delegated subtree was selected. An isolated quota experiment remains a separate conditional observation and cannot be replaced by these shared hierarchy snapshots.'),
'T43.11.b':('Keyed parsers handle reordered and optional fields. A decreasing gauge is valid; a decreasing monotonic counter is a reset. Device8:0 matches by identity before an8192-byte delta; read-only peak stays historical.','Disappearing8:1 and new8:2 produce unknown deltas. Shared-inode writeback remains an attribution limit even when device parsing is correct.'),
'T43.11.c':('The bounded owned workload runs between read-only snapshots. Its0/1MiB/0 payload ledger stays separate from aggregate cgroup memory, CPU and IO. Quota fractions and overlapping PSI do not force equality with object costs.','Captured child quota.8 and ancestor.5 cannot promise.8 CPU share. Burst200 and throttle300 are scoped records, not quantities to force into wall-minus-CPU or summed PSI.'),
'T43.12.a':('The same retained kernel runs as baseline, compiler hooks and-pg at compile and link. The bounded recorder excludes itself; gmon is produced by normal exit in an owned directory.','The executed uninstrumented helper has no hook boundary. Its nm address is checked against the trace so absence is disclosed instead of interpreted as zero executions.'),
'T43.12.b':('The C reducer gives work9/4, child5/5 and recursive inclusive7/exclusive5. Dropped, open or unmatched traces invalidate exact totals. Actual hook logs have an independent reduction.','Interleaved task IDs need separate invocation stacks. Properly nested tasks0 and1 overlap and aggregate9 inclusive units; one global LIFO stack is insufficient.'),
'T43.12.c':('Matched baseline, hook and-pg runtimes, code sizes and frame files expose instrumentation changes. Two expensive and eight cheap calls distinguish actual caller cost from uniform attribution; the captured4/16 estimate differs from16/4.','Batch bracketing reduces timestamp cost per call but measures batch elapsed time and hides individual tails. CPU samples, call counts, inclusive wall time and off-CPU delay remain distinct.'),
'T43.13.a':('The captured DWT certificate checks premises in order. Clear TRCENA makes feature presence unknown; absent, unowned and disabled have separate outcomes. No MMIO or trace ownership configuration occurs.','A peripheral timer requires its own access gate, divider, clock domain, width and ownership. CPU frequency cannot substitute without source authority.'),
'T43.13.b':('The32-bit wrap from4294967280 to48 gives64 cycles. Bound1000 admits4000ns at16MHz; a full wrap or bound32 rejects. Subtracting overhead8 gives a separate3500ns sensitivity.','With an unknown split between16MHz and8MHz,64 cycles bounds duration to4000..8000ns. A known32/32-cycle split gives6000ns; a single-frequency conversion is unsupported.'),
'T43.13.c':('Captured arithmetic, prior functional guest work and physical observations remain separate. GPIO or timer cross-checks need actual resolution and halt evidence. This campaign supplies no silicon energy or WCET result.','Cortex-M7 needs fresh cache state, wait-state, DMA coherence, interrupt and clock premises. A functional pass or another core model does not transfer physical timing.'),
'T43.14.a':('Latency, throughput, retained bytes and traffic form the minimum vector for the four requirements, each with units and thresholds. Energy is unavailable and not inferred from elapsed time.','A new hard stack bound invalidates a timing-only decision until call paths, indirect targets, recursion, interrupts and dynamic frames are bounded. Actual .su qualifiers expose the unresolved work.'),
'T43.14.b':('Synthetic B fails the code and storage limits despite lower modeled cycles. Actual binary search and retained lookup return equal query results with262144 versus786436 retained bytes; timing order is disclosed.','A stricter tail deadline may favor a larger candidate only after fresh tail evidence and every hard limit pass. A median advantage cannot certify a deadline or override a storage budget.')}
